{
  "$comment": "Claude Code 项目级 MCP 示例（R135 压力测试崩点 4）：复制到仓库根并改名为 .mcp.json 即可在 Claude Code 中接入与 .codex/config.toml 对应的服务器。主链路四项（context7/motion/shadcn/playwright）与 config.toml 同参同版；motion_plus/figma/stitch 为可选服务未启用，见文件末尾 $commentOptional，启用时移入 mcpServers 并补 type 字段。带 env 的字段请用你自己的 key，勿提交真实密钥。",
  "mcpServers": {
    "context7": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.context7.com/mcp"
    },
    "motion": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.motion.dev"
    },
    "shadcn": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "shadcn@4.21.0", "mcp"]
    },
    "playwright": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@playwright/mcp@0.0.80", "--headless", "--isolated"]
    }
  },
  "$commentOptional": "未启用的可选服务（启用时移入 mcpServers 并补 type: http）：motion_plus → https://mcp.motion.dev/plus；figma → https://mcp.figma.com/mcp；stitch → https://stitch.googleapis.com/mcp（config.toml 中 stitch 另带 http_headers 认证头，用你自己的 key）。"
}
